flowchart RL
    N0[Notify]
    N1[Fetch done]
    N2(Validate)
    N3([Check])
    N4(Fetch)
    N5(Emit)
    N6{Validate done}
    N7(Check)
    N0 -->|ok| N1
    N1 --> N2
    N0 --> N3
    N2 --> N4
    N2 -->|next| N5
    N5 -->|ok| N6
    N6 --> N7
    N2 --> N3
    N2 --> N6
    N2 --> N6
    N6 ==>|back| N0
    N6 -.-> N2
    N5 --> N1
